## 8. Testing Strategy

{{#if narrative}}
{{narrative}}
{{else}}
- **Unit:** core domain logic isolated per port.
- **Integration:** real adapters via tmpdir / Testcontainers; Claude provider always mocked.
- **Contract tests:** verify port implementations against shared specs.
- **E2E:** end-to-end CLI invocation with stub Claude provider.
- **Coverage gates:** domain ≥ 80%, adapters ≥ 60%.
{{/if}}
